Clinical Course: The prognosis for regaining walking ability depends entirely on how quickly the pressure can be relieved at the hospital.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Daughter: Do not attempt to move, turn, or lift the patient under any circumstances while waiting for the ambulance. Keep them strictly flat on their back.

